    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to one of Ireland's most beautiful coastal homes. Idyllically located close to the charming town of Kilmuckridge, our luxury villa rental provides easy access to sandy beaches and other amenities.\r\nDesigned by one of Ireland’s leading contemporary architects, Captiva Villa needs to be viewed to appreciate its many outstanding characteristics fully. The 6,000 sq ft of bright open living spaces are complete with a generous 3,500 sq ft of outdoor entertainment patio. \r\n\r\nThis Intelligent Eco-friendly home incorporates everything you need with all the conveniences and technology of a modern home.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nThere are six spacious ensuite bedrooms, all featuring satellite TV, Wi-Fi and streaming HD music. Some of the many other key features include; a full bar, large hot tub, pool table, cinema room, tennis court and children's play areas.\r\n\r\nPerfect for Five Star clients who require an exceptional rental property while in Ireland \r\n\r\nLocation & Views\r\n1. Views of rolling hills – beautiful Irish Countryside\r\n2. Close to the beaches\r\n3. 2.3 Km from quaint Kilmuckridge Village\r\n\r\nSpecial Features of the house\r\n1. Six spacious bedrooms (all ensuite)\r\n2. Huge kitchen, living and dining area\r\n3. Fantastic for kids – large playroom with video games.\r\n4. Large outdoor playground, tennis court & cycle path\r\n4. Movie Theatre / Pool Room / Bar\r\n5. 8-Seat Hot Tub\r\n6. AV Distribution (HD Movies & Sports)\r\n7. located close to the charming village of Kilmuckridge\r\n\r\nSpecial feature of the location\r\n1. Close to the beaches\r\n2. Surrounded by beautiful quiet countryside \r\n3. Very convenient as a base for touring Ireland\r\n4. The Sunny South East – we get the best weather in Ireland\r\n5. Local shops, pubs and business’ are only 2km away\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKilmuckridge \r\nThe local beaches are the main attraction of the area and are part of a long stretch of unbroken sandy beach that connects Cahore to Raven Point. This is said to be one of the longest stretches of beach in Europe. Morriscastle, the most famous beach in Kilmuckridge, is popular with swimmers, walkers, horse riders, anglers and currently holds a prestigious Blue Flag award, granted due to its excellent water quality, safety, well-managed environment and good local services. \r\n\r\nThe local coast is host to much rare flora and fauna and is part of a national Heritage Site Kilmuckridge-Tinnaberna Sandhills. Morriscastle has also been awarded the Green Coast Beaches award. Kilmuckridge contains several historical buildings as well as restaurants, guesthouses, pubs, and shops\r\n\r\nCo Wexford Heritage Trail\r\nAn age-old gateway into Ireland, County Wexford is steeped in history dating back to the Stone Age, over 6,000 years ago. Journey through time and meet our ancestors - Celts, Christians, Vikings, Normans, French, Welsh and English - who have left us a quite remarkable heritage, unrivalled anywhere else in Ireland.\r\n\r\nNow, for the first time, Wexford’s history, culture and magnificent landscape are presented to you in an extraordinary way, on the Wexford Heritage Trail. From mountain to sea, mainland to islands, our trail leads you to castles, churches and abbeys, battlefields, historic towns and villages, great houses and gardens, windmills and forts. Explore the world’s oldest lighthouse, Ireland’s biggest open-air museum, and its most famous Famine Ship! Discover a landscape rich in biodiversity, from unique coastal habitats to the famous Wexford Slobs, a haven for wildlife and one of the most important wild bird reserves in the world.\r\n\r\nAlong our Trail, follow in the footsteps of monarchs and monks, knights and warriors, rebels and rogues, gentry and even the odd ghost! Wexford Heritage Trail has something for everyone - you won’t be disappointed!\r\n\r\nBlackwater Open Farm (15 mins)\r\nA fun day out for the whole family, meet the animals, play in the playground, ride the tractors and enjoy a bite to eat at our restaurant. \r\n•Indoor Bouncy Castles\r\n•Pedal Go-Kart Track\r\n•Indoor and Outdoor Tractor Track\r\n•Climbing Frames & Playground"
      },
      {
