        "Content": "Luxurious Villa in scenic location\r\n Over 6,000sq ft of living spaces\r\n Outdoor patio of 3,500 sq ft\r\n Panoramic countryside views\r\n Within 5 minutes of Kilmuckridge town\r\n 6 ensuite bedrooms"
      }
